sequenceDiagram
  participant T as Tomasz
  participant O as Overseer
  participant M as Meeseeks
  participant W as Worker
  M->>O: ask permit
  alt normal
    O-->>M: permit
  else breaker (usage limit or disk < 10 GB)
    O-->>M: no permit (paused until Tomasz resumes)
  end
  T->>O: kill (chat)
  O->>O: stop all permits (journal)
  O->>W: stop order
  W->>W: stop containers + brain processes
  W-->>O: confirm kill
  Note over W: no server contact 60 s -> worker stops itself
  Note over O: test: 0 containers, 0 brains, no new iteration
